    "status": "present",
    "value": "A city map is a list of equal-length strings in which 'D' marks a store, ' ' an open cell and 'X' a blocked cell. For each queried cell, report the smallest number of up, down, left or right steps through non-blocked cells needed to reach any store. A store cell reports 0. Report -1 for a blocked cell or for a cell from which no store can be reached."
  },
